# QML is text. Saying so out loud because it took a stray NUL byte inside a
# string literal in qshell/components/NotificationCard.qml — one byte, no
# behavioral effect — to make git call the file binary, drop it from every
# `git diff`, and make it invisible to plain `grep -r`. The byte is gone; this
# keeps the next one from hiding anything.
*.qml diff
*.qml text
